  "intro": {
    "zh": "米色纸面上只用钴蓝一种颜色：衬线大标题、细线和竖条纹装饰；适合设计研究报告、工作室年刊、艺术与学术出版物。",
    "en": "One electric cobalt on cream paper: large serif headlines, hairline rules and a vertical-stripe ornament; for design research reports, studio annuals and art or academic publications.",
